  "details": "That would be very appreciated if they were added into the default game as default features. Thank you.\n\n1. Openvr FSR.\n2. Haptics and Face Tracking improvements. (VRCFaceTracking, VRCBhapticsIntegration)\n3. Avatar size changer with bug free viewpoint. (ScaleGoesBrr)\n4. Avatar interactive hands/limb/body holding/posing. (ml_alg)\n5. Record animated/still motions of full avatars for photos/film. (FreezeFrame)\n6. Toggle chairs on any avatar. (SeatMod)\n7. IK customization. (IKTweaks)\n8. Join/Leave instance notifications. (JoinNotifier)\n9. Sort social list by public or private world. (PrivateInstanceIcon)\n10. Inventory system across all avatars, like torches/lamps (local or global), portable video player, props. But disable them in pvp worlds by a game world tag, or option for world creators to disable player inventory.\n11. Options to turn off chairs, pickups, pens, videoplayers, postprocessing. (ComponentToggle)\n12. A tidy compact numbered instance player list (with rank and friend colors) on the quick menu with pings, quest/pc, avatar performance and instance owner information. (PlayerList)\n13. Anti-Crash, limiters. (AdvancedSafety,FinalIKSanity, NetworkSanity,Particle&DynBone limiter, etc)\nBringing these back into the game will ease the frustrations and bring back players.",
